## Validation Checklist

Before calling `submit_plan()`, verify:
- [ ] Each step has: description, target_agent, phase_name, phase_order
- [ ] Steps use real IDs from research (not placeholders)
- [ ] Goal is specific and measurable
- [ ] Steps are ordered logically (dependencies respected)

## Submit

Call `submit_plan()` with:
```json
{
  "context": "...",
  "analysis": "...",
  "goal": "...",
  "steps": [
    {"description": "...", "target_agent": "...", "phase_name": "Execution", "phase_order": 1}
  ]
}
```
